  <h1>Age 17–18: Specialization & Portfolio</h1>
  <p class="lead">Published on 7 February 2025 on the legacy site and attributed there to Devina, this roadmap focused on choosing a technical specialization, developing larger projects, preparing a portfolio, and building readiness for further study.</p>
</section>
<section class="shell section"><div class="grid">
  <article class="card"><div class="tag">Specialization</div><h3>Choose a direction</h3><p class="muted">The original plan proposed paths such as software engineering, AI/data, mobile, cybersecurity, and cloud/DevOps.</p></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="tag">Projects</div><h3>Build larger systems</h3><p class="muted">Planning, implementation, testing, debugging, deployment, and optimization were treated as the core of project-based learning.</p></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="tag">Practice</div><h3>Problem solving</h3><p class="muted">Competitive programming, data structures, coding challenges, and real-world cases appeared as practice mechanisms.</p></article>
