<section class="shell section"><div class="panel"><div class="tag">Current Relevance</div><div class="big">Portfolio-first thinking still fits the current direction.</div><p class="muted">The strongest idea in the historical roadmap is not a specific framework or career path, but the emphasis on visible projects and evidence. The current Science → Engineering → Aerospace portfolio keeps that principle while narrowing the long-term academic direction.</p></div></section>
